synonym: "muscular dystrophy limb-girdle type 2H" RELATED [GARD:0003844]
synonym: "muscular dystrophy, limb-girdle, autosomal recessive 8" EXACT [OMIM:254110]
synonym: "muscular dystrophy, limb-girdle, type 2H" RELATED []
