[Term]
id: MONDO:0010790
name: MERRF syndrome
def: "A rare mitochondrial oxidative phosphorylation disorder characterized by myoclonic seizures, ataxia, generalized epilepsy, muscle weakness and ragged red fibers in the muscle biopsy." [Orphanet:551]
