synonym: "desminopathy" EXACT [DOID:0080092, Orphanet:98909]
synonym: "IBM1" RELATED DEPRECATED [OMIM:601419, Wikipedia:Hereditary_inclusion_body_myopathy]
synonym: "inclusion body myopathy 1, autosomal dominant" RELATED [OMIM:601419]
synonym: "MFM1" RELATED ABBREVIATION []
