synonym: "CMT/HMSN" EXACT ABBREVIATION [Orphanet:166]
synonym: "hereditary motor and sensory neuropathy" BROAD []
synonym: "hereditary sensorimotor neuropathy" BROAD []
synonym: "peroneal muscular atrophy" EXACT [ICD9CM:356.1]
