is_a: MONDO:0100577 {source="https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5208-3432"} ! myoclonic epilepsy
is_a: MONDO:0800488 {source="https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5208-3432", source="https://www.epilepsydiagnosis.org/syndrome/mei-overview.html"} ! neonatal/infantile-onset self-limited epilepsy syndrome
intersection_of: MONDO:0100577 ! myoclonic epilepsy
