def: "Any disorder caused by a heterozygous variant or biallelic variants in the AFG3L2 gene and characterized by a spectrum of phenotypes including optic atrophy and/or spastic ataxia." [https://clinicalgenome.org/affiliation/40077, PMID:32219868]
