name: Mitochondrial RNase P complex
synonym: "mitochondrial PRORP" RELATED []
synonym: "mt-RNase P complex" RELATED []
synonym: "protein only RNase P" RELATED []
synonym: "proteinaceous RNase P" RELATED []
is_a: SO:0005855 ! gene group
property_value: terms:description "Metazoans have two RNase P enzymes: a nuclear RNA-based RNase P and a mitochondrial PRORP (protein-only RNase P). Human mitochondrial RNase P consists of three subunits and lacks an RNA component. RNase P enzymes are metal ion-dependent endonucleases: hydrolases that catalyze site-specific phosphodiester bond hydrolysis primarily within pre-tRNA." xsd:string

