synonym: "Mitochondrial CHCHD-containing proteins" RELATED []
synonym: "Mitochondrial coiled-coil-helix-coiled-coil-helix domain containing proteins" RELATED []
synonym: "Twin CX9C motif family" RELATED []
is_a: SO:0005855 ! gene group

