synonym: "Matrin/U1-C-like, C2H2-type zinc finger" RELATED []
synonym: "ZMAT" RELATED OMO:0003000 []
is_a: https://www.genenames.org/data/genegroup/#!/group/26 ! Zinc fingers
property_value: terms:description "Genes encoding proteins that contain U1-type zinc finger domains, a family of C2H2-type zinc fingers present in matrin, U1 small nuclear ribonucleoprotein C and other RNA-binding proteins." xsd:string

